            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Force quit is easier to find</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Unresponsive windows now show a dimmed ⌥ instead of nothing.</li>
  <li>The badge no longer replays its entrance animation when ⌥ changes it.</li>
  <li>Licence management moved to a single button.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
